<p>So&#8230; I'm wondering what your opinion on the anafabula is.</p>
<p>Whatever entity is behind the Fifth church is pretty horrifying, obviously. There's some great Antimemetics Department stories referencing it, and they have an interpretation that the Cosmic Starfish Thingy is actively &quot;erasing&quot; everything from existence that becomes aware of it to any significant degree, but it's doing so with an incredibly powerful antimemetic effect.</p>
